      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u47OyZHHeia83FyIG8AVrDRi90c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/85337-microwave-baked-potato-step-02-f072b0255fa44512af391d89836ee0d6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/85337/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove potato from the microwave, and cut in half lengthwise. Season with salt and pepper and mash up the inside a little with a fork.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-7QoBv0edXhUKOlPza6-lxW1CCU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/85337-microwave-baked-potato-step-3-09-4b46b4636f37479381fe657d9dc24dd8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/85337/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add butter and Cheddar cheese. Microwave until melted, about 1 more minute.",
